#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s.rst:4
msgid ""
"You can use the Mattermost Kubernetes Operator to deploy Mattermost on "
"Kubernetes using S3-compatible storage and a managed database service. "
"While the operator supports a range of configurations, we strongly "
"recommend using a cloud-native approach for production environments."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST Kubernetes Operator를 사용하면 S3 호환 저장소와 관리형 데이터베이스 "
"서비스를 사용하여 Kubernetes에 OKR.BEST를 배포할 수 있습니다. operator는 다양한 "
"구성을 지원하지만, 운영 환경에서는 클라우드 네이티브 방식을 사용할 것을 강력히 "
"권장합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s.rst:7
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "사전 요구 사항"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s.rst:9
msgid "Before you begin, ensure you have the following:"
msgstr "시작하기 전에 다음을 갖추고 있는지 확인하세요:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s.rst:11
msgid ""
"A functioning Kubernetes cluster (see the `Kubernetes setup guide "
"<https://kubernetes.io/docs/setup/>`__). Your cluster should be running a"
" `supported Kubernetes version <https://kubernetes.io/releases/>`__."
msgstr ""
"작동하는 Kubernetes 클러스터(`Kubernetes 설정 가이드 "
"<https://kubernetes.io/docs/setup/>`__ 참고). 클러스터는 `지원되는 Kubernetes "
"버전 <https://kubernetes.io/releases/>`__\\ 을 실행하고 있어야 합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s.rst:12
msgid ""
"The `kubectl` command-line tool installed on your local machine (see the "
"`kubectl installation guide "
"<https://kubernetes.io/docs/reference/kubectl/>`__)."
msgstr ""
"로컬 머신에 설치된 `kubectl` 명령줄 도구(`kubectl 설치 가이드 "
"<https://kubernetes.io/docs/reference/kubectl/>`__ 참고)."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s.rst:13
msgid ""
"A fundamental understanding of Kubernetes concepts, such as deployments, "
"pods, and applying manifests."
msgstr ""
"디플로이먼트, 파드, 매니페스트 적용 같은 Kubernetes 개념에 대한 기본적인 이해."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s.rst:14
msgid ""
"Sufficient Kubernetes resources allocated based on your expected user "
"load. Consult the :ref:`scaling for Enterprise <administration-"
"guide/scale/scaling-for-enterprise:available reference architectures>` "
"documentation for resource requirements at different scales."
msgstr ""
"예상 사용자 부하를 기준으로 할당된 충분한 Kubernetes 리소스. 다양한 규모에서의 "
"리소스 요구 사항은 :ref:`엔터프라이즈 확장 <administration-guide/scale/scaling-"
"for-enterprise:available reference architectures>` 문서를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s.rst:17
msgid "Installation steps"
msgstr "설치 단계"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s.rst:19
msgid ""
"The installation process involves setting up necessary operators and then"
" deploying Mattermost itself."
msgstr ""
"설치 과정은 필요한 operator를 설정한 다음 OKR.BEST 자체를 배포하는 것을 "
"포함합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s.rst:22
msgid "Step 1: Install the NGINX Ingress Controller"
msgstr "1단계: NGINX Ingress Controller 설치"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s.rst:24
msgid ""
"Follow the instructions in the `Kubernetes deployment documentation "
"<https://kubernetes.github.io/ingress-nginx/deploy/>`_ to install the "
"NGINX ingress controller on your Kubernetes cluster. Mattermost "
"recommends installing the Nginx Operator via helm, regardless of platform"
" you are installing to."
msgstr ""
"`Kubernetes 배포 문서 <https://kubernetes.github.io/ingress-nginx/deploy/>`_\\ "
"의 안내에 따라 Kubernetes 클러스터에 NGINX ingress controller를 설치하세요. "
"OKR.BEST는 설치하는 플랫폼에 관계없이 helm을 통해 Nginx Operator를 설치할 것을 "
"권장합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s.rst:27
msgid "Step 2: Install the Mattermost Operator"
msgstr "2단계: OKR.BEST Operator 설치"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s.rst:29
msgid "The Mattermost Kubernetes Operator can be installed using Helm."
msgstr "OKR.BEST Kubernetes Operator는 Helm을 사용하여 설치할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s.rst:31
msgid ""
"Install Helm (version 3.13.0 or later). See the `Helm quickstart "
"documentation <https://helm.sh/docs/using_helm/>`_ for installation "
"instructions."
msgstr ""
"Helm(버전 3.13.0 이상)을 설치합니다. 설치 안내는 `Helm 빠른 시작 문서 "
"<https://helm.sh/docs/using_helm/>`_\\ 를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s.rst:33
msgid "Add the Mattermost Helm repository:"
msgstr "Mattermost Helm 저장소를 추가합니다:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s.rst:39
msgid ""
"Create a file named ``config.yaml`` and populate it with the contents of "
"the `Mattermost operator values file <https://github.com/mattermost"
"/mattermost-helm/blob/master/charts/mattermost-operator/values.yaml>`_. "
"This file allows for customization of the operator."
msgstr ""
"``config.yaml``\\ 이라는 파일을 만들고 `Mattermost operator values 파일 "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-helm/blob/master/charts/mattermost-"
"operator/values.yaml>`_\\ 의 내용으로 채웁니다. 이 파일을 통해 operator를 사용자 "
"지정할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s.rst:41
msgid "Create a namespace for the Mattermost Operator:"
msgstr "OKR.BEST Operator용 네임스페이스를 생성합니다:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s.rst:47
msgid ""
"Install the Mattermost Operator. If you don't specify a version, the "
"latest version of the Mattermost Operator will be installed. We recommend"
" using the latest version of the Mattermost Operator."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST Operator를 설치합니다. 버전을 지정하지 않으면 최신 버전의 OKR.BEST "
"Operator가 설치됩니다. 최신 버전의 OKR.BEST Operator를 사용할 것을 권장합니다."

