#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s.rst:249
msgid ""
"If you're new to Kubernetes or prefer a managed solution, consider using "
"a service like `Amazon EKS <https://aws.amazon.com/eks/>`_, `Azure "
"Kubernetes Service <https://azure.microsoft.com/en-ca/products"
"/kubernetes-service/>`_, `Google Kubernetes Engine "
"<https://cloud.google.com/kubernetes-engine/>`_, or `DigitalOcean "
"Kubernetes <https://www.digitalocean.com/products/kubernetes/>`_. While "
"this guidance focuses on using external, managed services for your "
"database and file storage, the Mattermost Operator *does* offer the "
"flexibility to use other solutions. For example, you could choose to "
"deploy a PostgreSQL database within your Kubernetes cluster using the "
"CloudNative PG operator (or externally however you wish), or use any "
"self-hosted S3-compatible storage service."
msgstr ""
"Kubernetes를 처음 사용하거나 관리형 솔루션을 선호한다면 `Amazon EKS "
"<https://aws.amazon.com/eks/>`_, `Azure Kubernetes Service "
"<https://azure.microsoft.com/en-ca/products/kubernetes-service/>`_, `Google "
"Kubernetes Engine <https://cloud.google.com/kubernetes-engine/>`_, "
"`DigitalOcean Kubernetes <https://www.digitalocean.com/products/kubernetes/>`_ "
"같은 서비스를 사용하는 것을 고려하세요. 이 안내는 데이터베이스와 파일 저장소에 "
"외부 관리형 서비스를 사용하는 데 중점을 두지만, OKR.BEST Operator는 다른 솔루션을 "
"사용할 수 있는 유연성도 *제공합니다*. 예를 들어 CloudNative PG operator를 사용하여 "
"Kubernetes 클러스터 내에 PostgreSQL 데이터베이스를 배포하거나(또는 원하는 방식으로 "
"외부에 배포), 셀프 호스팅 S3 호환 스토리지 서비스를 사용할 수도 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s.rst:250
msgid ""
"While using managed cloud services is generally simpler to maintain and "
"our recommended approach for production deployments, using self-managed "
"S3-compatible storage services and CloudNative PG for PostgreSQL are also"
" valid options if you have the expertise to manage them."
msgstr ""
"관리형 클라우드 서비스를 사용하는 것이 일반적으로 유지 관리가 더 간단하고 운영 "
"배포에 권장하는 방식이지만, 관리할 전문성이 있다면 자체 관리형 S3 호환 스토리지 "
"서비스와 PostgreSQL용 CloudNative PG를 사용하는 것도 유효한 옵션입니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s.rst:251
msgid ""
"If you choose to use self-managed components, you'll need to adapt the "
"instructions accordingly, pointing to your internal services instead."
msgstr ""
"자체 관리형 구성 요소를 사용하기로 선택했다면, 그에 맞게 안내를 조정하여 대신 내부 "
"서비스를 가리키도록 해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s.rst:252
msgid ""
"To customize your production deployment, refer to the :doc:`configuration"
" settings documentation </administration-guide/configure/configuration-"
"settings>`."
msgstr ""
"운영 배포를 사용자 지정하려면 :doc:`구성 설정 문서 </administration-guide"
"/configure/configuration-settings>`\\ 를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s.rst:253
msgid ""
"If you encounter issues during deployment, consult the :doc:`deployment "
"troubleshooting guide </deployment-guide/deployment-troubleshooting>`."
msgstr ""
"배포 중 문제가 발생하면 :doc:`배포 문제 해결 가이드 </deployment-guide"
"/deployment-troubleshooting>`\\ 를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s.rst:256
msgid "Frequently Asked Questions"
msgstr "자주 묻는 질문"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s.rst:259
msgid "What is the Operator's version compatibility with Mattermost Server?"
msgstr "Operator의 OKR.BEST 서버 버전 호환성은 어떻게 되나요?"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s.rst:261
msgid ""
"While generally speaking, the Operator should be compatible with most, or"
" all versions of Mattermost Server, we recommend always using the latest "
"version of the Operator in conjunction with a :doc:`supported version "
"</product-overview/release-policy>` of Mattermost Server."
msgstr ""
"일반적으로 Operator는 대부분 또는 모든 버전의 OKR.BEST 서버와 호환되지만, 항상 "
"최신 버전의 Operator를 :doc:`지원되는 버전 </product-overview/release-policy>`\\ "
"의 OKR.BEST 서버와 함께 사용할 것을 권장합니다."

